{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19105160","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19105160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1910515001:0":{"text":"어이, 덩치!","source_cn":"喂，大个子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB006FDCD0FFC38FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1910516001:0":{"text":"우리는 각자 조사한 내용을 간단히 공유했다","source_cn":"你们简单交流了查探到的信息","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7E28751E70F0D812","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리는 각자 조사한 내용을 간단히 공유했다","female":"우리는 각자 조사한 내용을 간단히 공유했다","variant_male_record_index":"251752","variant_female_record_index":"251753","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910516002:1":{"text":"응, 확실한 건 타라사에서도 그... 그 소리를 듣기 시작한 사람이 있다는 거야. 하지만 아무런 전조도 없다고 했어.","source_cn":"嗯，可以肯定，塔拉萨中也有人开始听到那种……那种声音。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64FCF6C8ADA1FC8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910516003:1":{"text":"和我之前听到的一样：鼓声，感觉有人在耳边说话，但是找不到发出声音的源头。而且就算仅仅相距一两米，附近其他人也听不见。","source_cn":"和我之前听到的一样：鼓声，感觉有人在耳边说话，但是找不...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF5BFC4E33E7FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910516004:1":{"text":"我劝听到声音的人先休息，最好找家人多陪陪自己，无论如何，他们感受到的恐慌都是真的。","source_cn":"我劝听到声音的人先休息，最好找家人多陪陪自己，无论如何...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x3723E624DEEC832E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910516005:1":{"text":"소리를 들은 사람이 몇 명 안 되긴 했어. 예전의 나라면 걔네가 미쳤다고 생각했을걸.","source_cn":"能听到声音的人没几个，要是以前，咱一定以为他们疯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99321DB28C7F7C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910516006:1":{"text":"그나마 다행인 건, 적어도 아직까진 미치지 않았다는 거야. 하지만 앞으로는 어떨지...","source_cn":"好消息是，至少他们现在还没发疯。但说不准以后——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30B04119E897F690","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910516007:1":{"text":"앞으로도 안 미쳐!","source_cn":"以后也不会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1EDDEED794148E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910516008:1":{"text":"...그러니까... 그...","source_cn":"……咱是说……呃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x953F8740685A644E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910516009:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 다들 심해족처럼 변하지 않을 거야. 그렇지, 응?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49C4FD69F3E581BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<sty